      "content": "thanks. the traditionalist one is good, very calm. but the progressive one feels a little... i don't know, maybe a bit too much like a caricature? they sound almost angry or just loud for the sake of being loud. \n\ncan u try rewriting the progressive monologue? i want them to be \"intense\" like i asked, but i also want them to be just as smart and articulate as the traditionalist. like, i want the audience to actually respect their logic even if they disagree with the radicalism. can u make them sound more like a brilliant strategist rather than just someone who is upset?",
